observed = "HolderRewardsView mounts GridView for a nonempty grid, but the only LoadMore control is inside the alternative HolderRewardsTable. The grid receives no hasMore, loadMore or error state, so a visitor cannot reach the next IF_HOLDER_REWARDS_POOLS page without switching views."
