observed = "useLiveDirectory refreshes the first five pages every ten seconds, but useLiveDirectoryContinuation caches later pages with infinite staleTime and has no refetch interval or invalidation link to that refresh. If the boundary cursor stays the same, later streams and viewer counts can remain permanently stale in an active directory, including streams that have ended."
